/*
 Cards
 */

"aceOfPentacles_description" = "Today, luck will follow you around. Be extremely careful, do not miss your chances, they lie in wait for you in different places and at the most unexpected time. Invest in those plans that are long-term and realistic, especially when it comes to career and earnings. If all plans are only short-term, then today will be a great start for far-reaching tasks.";
"aceOfSwords_description" = "Today you will have the opportunity to solve a problem over which you had to rack your brains for a long time, the solution will be right in front of your nose. Be especially careful today so as not to miss this opportunity, every day such chances do not lie on the road.";
"aceOfWands_description" = "Today you have enough energy to take on a new project. It is possible to move unresolved issues and problems “from the dead point”. Whatever idea you have visited, you can safely take on its implementation. You will succeed. Passion for creative discoveries will not leave your colleagues indifferent. They will support you in your projects. It is possible that unexpected information will appear that will open up new opportunities. Even non-standard solutions and crazy ideas can bring good cash income. It is also possible to receive news that may affect one of the areas of life.";
"aceOfCups_description" = "A surprise for you - this is a card foreshadowing the fulfillment of a cherished desire. Everything that you think during this day will surely come true, take this chance. The card also indicates changes in your amorous affairs. Intuition tells you that something promising will happen, it is connected with a person from the environment. Today you will experience happiness like never before.";
"twoOfPentacles_description" = "Вам сегодня не нужно слишком серьезно относиться к своей трудовой деятельности. Вполне будет достаточно немного игривости, гибкости и легкомысленности. Не отказывайтесь от возможности попробовать что-то новое, дабы проверить свои способности. И даже если что-то не получится у вас сразу, всегда можно повторить попытку. В этот день вы будете хорошо приспосабливаться к полученным заданиям. Могут также произойти у вас некоторые изменения в бизнесе, связанные с незначительной прибылью. Карта несет освобождение от унылости, и вам нужно правильно распорядиться этим днем.";
"twoOfSwords_description" = "Today you will be overcome by doubts and worries. It may seem to you that your intuition is silent. If on this day you will need to make a very important decision, it is better not to do it. Tomorrow will come - then we'll see. It's just not the right day for it. Don't worry, use this day for rest, meditation and reflection.";
"twoOfWands_description" = "Throw away all doubts and worries, the right decision today is to take a neutral side. If someone asks you more than you can do, say so. It is enough for you to clearly explain to the interlocutor your attitude to the matter, without imposing much responsibility on yourself. We can say that you will do it better tomorrow, not today. Thus, you can avoid unnecessary problems and stress.";
"twoOfCups_description" = "Today you will remember the affairs of the heart, where there will be deep sympathy, love, spiritual contact or reconciliation. If you have a loved one who is already a spouse, then there will be a period when you can relive those first relationships and love that have not faded so far, but even strengthened.";
"threeOfPentacles_description" = "The Three of Pentacles recommends today to abandon the remnants of the past that hinder your development and move to a qualitatively new level. The form of this refusal may be different for you - you can finally find out the relationship with your partner, change jobs or finish a job that has been started for a long time. In any case, this should be the end of some routine stage of a past life, which will allow you to start a new business. Also, do not be afraid to enlist support and help, this will give you a faster and easier movement towards your plans.";
"threeOfSwords_description" = "Today is not a very happy day. At work, bad news may await. Alternatively, it will be necessary to make the right decision, which will require serious emotional effort. Do not be discouraged, try to withstand the blows of fate that await you on this day. You shouldn't bend your back in front of trouble. You need to steadfastly endure negative events so that there is hope for the beginning of a bright streak in life.";
"threeOfWands_description" = "You have clear life guidelines. You are on the right path to your spiritual development. Today, perhaps, one of the colleagues will offer a part-time job. Perhaps - joint participation in the case, and therefore you need to agree. Joint activities will allow you to realize your creative potential. If you try, you can make good money. Using this chance, you can think about changing your profession. In a new type of activity, you will be able to fully realize your potential. At the same time, profits will increase.";
"threeOfCups_description" = "Today will surely bring you a joyful event or good news. Mark it, share your good mood with your close circle. Invite family and friends to your place for a cozy delicious dinner, drink a wonderful bottle of wine that was once left in reserve. Do not regret, this moment has already come, and such an excellent occasion does not happen every day. Thank fate for bringing you the sweetest fruits. Reconcile with old acquaintances with whom there were squabbles and failures in relationships. This day, like no other, will be especially favorable for this.";
"fourOfPentacles_description" = "You should consider whether the direction of your efforts is chosen correctly. Perhaps even this card indicates to you that you are spending all your energy on actions that only harm the implementation of your plans and stop you.";
"fourOfSwords_description" = "Today is the day for you to make a decision. No matter how much I would not like to postpone this moment, there is nowhere to pull further. The decision may concern one of the areas of your life. Once you take this important step, you will immediately feel better.";
"fourOfWands_description" = "Today is the day when you can do whatever your soul asks. You can safely meet new people, because there is a chance that among them there may be those who will become true friends. You can make a gift to your beloved (or beloved) or organize a real holiday. If there is a person with whom you are in a quarrel, this is the best day for reconciliation. Sad thoughts must be driven away from yourself on this day.";
"fourOfCups_description" = "Today, any little thing can spoil your mood. Health problems are also not ruled out. If there is a reason that causes you such feelings as sadness and longing, do not get carried away by these emotions, continue to be open to the world, which will definitely help you rehabilitate. In addition, there are many opportunities around that you should not miss out on your own stupidity.";
"fiveOfPentacles_description" = "You should not build far-reaching plans for such a day - all the same, things will not go the way they should and the way you would like. Perhaps you should think about changing your priorities in life. An unfavorable streak in life can be expected ahead. But life, as you know, is like a zebra, so you should accept the upcoming trials with dignity, endure them patiently, and things will get better quickly.";
"fiveOfSwords_description" = "Serious troubles may await you today. You need to be careful not to become a victim of scammers and thieves. At work and in your personal life, you need to prepare for possible conflicts. On this day, it is better not to do anything serious.";
"fiveOfWands_description" = "Today you have a test, so you need to be as prepared as possible for it. Do not worry about this, because this is a kind of exam, as a result of which, you will be able to confirm to yourself your ability to solve problems, which will positively affect your self-esteem. This can affect different areas, for example, psychological confrontation with a loved one or competition at work, and here and there you can’t give up, you need to show that you are still in great shape.";
"fiveOfCups_description" = "Today, inevitable disappointments and disappointments can happen. Even if it seemed to you that success is on your side, and everything works out in business, then this day will show you the other side of the issue. If it has something to do with minor flaws, then take it with humor. But if you have to be sad about a serious matter, then you need to accept everything with dignity, without hiding anything from other people. Therefore, try to assess the situation not fatally, but as soberly and sensibly as possible, do not give in to despondency, but think about how to improve the situation.";
"sixOfPentacles_description" = "Today is your day to help others. Do not skimp on a good deed, be generous and later it will return to you in a larger size, when difficulties arise in your life as well. If there is no way to lend, help physically, at least listen to the person with all your attention, give valuable and wise advice.";
"sixOfSwords_description" = "An interesting day awaits you today, which does not bode well. The card says that you need to prepare for change, and the sooner this happens, the easier it will be for you later. The main thing is to control your own destiny, and not depend on any circumstances.";
"sixOfWands_description" = "Today will be very successful for you, it will bring many pleasant surprises in the form of completed problems that you have been working on for a long period of time. The things you started recently will go uphill. It is worth remembering that only those cases that brought you headaches and big expenses will have a successful resolution, that is, achieving the goal will be fully justified and deserved for you. At the household level, a card may simply portend you with a monetary reward or bonus. It is worth sharing the taste of victory with loved ones, arrange a holiday! This will bring pleasant emotions to you and those around you.";
"sixOfCups_description" = "Today will give you memories. You will be able to understand yourself: what you wanted, what you dreamed about in the past, what came true and did not come true from this until today. Thanks to such an analysis, many forgotten dreams can come true. The past can really give clues to the present and future of you. There may be a meeting with someone who has not been seen for a long time, or maybe there will be an important thing that was once lost. You have a chance to become happy, joyful, in love again. Is it really possible to deny yourself the hope - to be happy, because for this we live.";
"sevenOfPentacles_description" = "Today is clearly not a rush day, you should be more patient and slow. Take into account every detail, weigh every decision in your head before you approve it. Any oversight today will provoke the emergence of difficult situations for you, the solution of which will require large material and energy costs in the future. It makes no sense to violate plans that are long and painfully implemented. If you are not in the mood for patience, just take a breather, relax, spend time with benefit, pay attention to those closest to you, surprise your loved one with a pleasant surprise. Kindness will definitely be returned to you.";
"sevenOfSwords_description" = "When leaving the house, it is advisable for you to hide important things securely, because there is a very high probability of theft. Also on this day, you may encounter betrayal and fraud. Solving some of your questions, you may have to be cunning and dodge, but the result for you will be positive. In any case, be on the lookout for the purity of your intentions and those of others.";
"sevenOfWands_description" = "The card says that today you will need to persevere in the affairs you have previously started, and success will not be long in coming. For what you need to fight and defend your position. Therefore, today do not spare your nerves, protecting yourself, you will avoid big problems.";
"sevenOfCups_description" = "The card says that you have fallen into the network of your own unfulfilled desires and illusions. You are removed from reality and this day can be wasted for you, unless, of course, you try to return to the real world. There is a high probability of becoming a victim of a scammer on this day if you chase ghostly earnings. Also on this day, you can fall in love with the fictional hero of your novel.";
"eightOfPentacles_description" = "On this day, you should not indulge in laziness, but hard work will bring you very tempting results. Today is a good day to discover your talent - you will definitely deserve recognition. Laziness can overcome you, unwillingness to work will push you to come up with some reason to shirk. You can even use false for this. So try not to succumb to the provocations of your body and the games of your mind, or simply provide yourself with a blanket with a cup of coffee in advance, if you really organize it.";
"eightOfSwords_description" = "Today is a day of complete isolation for you. This can happen to you either of your own free will, for example, you just want to take a day off from all business, or under the influence of unforeseen circumstances. The Eight of Swords also warns you that on this day you will have to experience fear. Also, the card may hint to you that today you will have to make a choice you have been putting off for a long time.";
"eightOfWands_description" = "Your day will be very busy today. You will have practically no time to relax, as events will develop at an insane pace. On this day, pleasant surprises, news, interesting meetings will fall on you. The main thing is to do everything and not fall off your feet from activity. You will have to spin like a squirrel in a wheel.";
"eightOfCups_description" = "On this day, you will face the fact that the old schemes no longer work. It's time for you to give them up, especially today all the surrounding circumstances will push you to this. Your mood on this day will be rather sad, and the state itself will be burdensome. It will be with some touch of soreness due to the fact that rose-colored glasses will fall from your eyes.";
"nineOfPentacles_description" = "Today is a very auspicious day for you, which will bring you a lot of pleasure from what is happening. On this day, all plans will be easily implemented by you, so use it correctly and for its intended purpose.";
"nineOfSwords_description" = "Today is a problematic day for you: everything that happens will make you worry quite a lot, and probably all the experience will come down to the fact that you just screwed yourself up. Fears can arise out of nowhere and are easily subdued. You need to call on a loved one to help you deal with the oppressive demons of the soul. Try not to make categorical decisions today.";
"nineOfWands_description" = "Today for you is a day of decisive action, reasonable stubbornness, perseverance and courage in making decisions. Now you are full of strength and energy to take some important step. Don't miss this amazing opportunity!";
"nineOfCups_description" = "Today you have an idle day on which you can indulge in laziness and relax, not for a minute thinking about any problems. Everything in your life goes on as usual, and your participation in this is not required. Today you can have parties or pleasant gatherings with friends, meeting with your loved one, and the evening promises to be very passionate. Your day will be so successful that you will fall asleep with a smile.";
"tenOfPentacles_description" = "This card promises you a great day today, which they say: everything is arguing in the hands. Any of your affairs on this day will bring success, especially when it comes to finances. A pleasant surprise for you may be a gift or help from close relatives. It is advisable for you to devote this day to your family as much as possible, or at least call your parents.";
"tenOfSwords_description" = "On this day, you will experience a lot of unpleasant things. As a result, you may feel that life has no further meaning, because it has reached a complete dead end. Forces seem to leave you forever and there may be a feeling of spiritual devastation. However, don't get depressed. One day of trouble is not your whole life. Tomorrow will be a new day and everything will change.";
"tenOfWands_description" = "Today promises you an unbearable lot of work, which can even lead you to extreme fatigue. You will not have the opportunity to shirk from it, and you will have to carry the burden that has been dumped on yourself without groans and groans. But do not despair - stock up on patience and endurance and do not forget to take a time out at least sometimes.";
"tenOfCups_description" = "On this day, you will rise in everything. Your business will be successfully moving forward, you will feel support from all sides. Harmony and mutual understanding will reign in the family. This is a wonderful day to improve relationships, make peace after a quarrel with a loved one or friends, put an end to a protracted dispute.";

/*
 Map
 */
"aceOfPentacles_map_description" = "The Ace of Pentacles is a card of resourcefulness, stability and financial independence - it symbolizes good luck, achievement, prosperity and independence. This is a chance from fate to find everything you need in order to stand firmly on your feet. The card speaks of imminent success, prosperity and moral satisfaction. The Ace of Pentacles is always personal growth, spiritual development and favorable changes at work. The Minor Arcana portends success and monetary reward. It is also possible to receive a decent share of the inheritance. The card says: keep your luck by the tail, pay attention to incoming information and ideas - maybe today is your chance to become famous. If you accidentally stumbled upon this card, then soon you will have a prosperity stage in your life. Perhaps new projects will begin that will be crowned with success. As a result, you will feel moral satisfaction. The Ace of Pentacles is always about personal growth. There is a chance that you will start doing something spiritual or get a promotion at work.";
"aceOfSwords_map_description" = "The Ace of Swords is the lasso of triumph and victory. This is a card of brilliant decisions and ideas, as well as getting rid of past mistakes and troubles. He personifies very high intellectual capabilities, as well as the strength and will of your character in relation to the fact that you do not have to put up with those circumstances that do not suit you. Leave all doubts behind. Bring clarity to all areas of your life, so life will become much easier and more fun, you won’t have to rack your brains every day over all sorts of little things. You can devote this time to something more. It is also a map of brilliant ideas and solutions. Perhaps you will have new plans and ideas that are destined to come true if you make enough effort. If at this moment in life there is a crisis moment, the card can be interpreted as the disappearance of troubles. If you decide on a new business, do not commit rash acts, act soberly, clearly evaluating your every step. You can use your own power, but do not overdo it. There is a possibility that a new stimulus will appear soon.";
"aceOfWands_map_description" = "The Ace of Wands is an amazing card that represents good luck and success, handed over by higher powers in all matters and undertakings. This is a map of open doors and roads, the disclosure of creativity and the flow of energy, a map of success and good luck in the future journey of life. But the path itself will have to be passed on its own, luck will accompany and favor in accordance with the ambition and enterprise of the one walking. The Ace of Wands denotes prospects, opening up opportunities for spiritual development, new open doors and accesses, vigor, courage, large-scale projects. The Ace of Wands is resourcefulness, courage, willingness to make certain sacrifices. In addition, this card means: optimism, inspiration, the disclosure of a person's creative potential. The key meaning of the Ace of Wands is something new. It may be a new project, the beginning of a life stage. Unfortunately, this period is unlikely to end successfully. Wands belong to the fiery element, therefore, the components of the card include: self-control, clarity in judgments and actions, adherence to moral principles, spiritual growth, as well as an open attitude to life and trust.";
"aceOfCups_map_description" = "The Ace of Cups is a sign of internal energy, openness of the soul to everything new, spiritual harmony and comfort. This is a blessing from above, a state of being filled with happiness and the energy of love. In a word, we can say that this is a card of bliss, full of love and positive emotions, reverence and blessing of the senses. Such an Arkan falling out in the layout indicates that happiness is at the door of the fortuneteller. This is a bright ray that appears in a dark soul, it expels all sadness, despondency, anger, fears from there. At the household level, the Ace of Cups falls out when some changes in routine life are expected. Those who are very much expected. This is a party, a feast, a wedding of a best friend, where you can have a good walk. This is a good, but old friend who suddenly appeared, who decided to establish a connection. The card well describes the state in which a person is as calm, happy and relaxed as possible. He does not feel the need for anything, even if there are any difficulties around. His soul is now so in its place that no difficulties are frightening. This is an inner light and wealth and breadth of the soul, which a person can and is ready to share with others.";
"twoOfPentacles_map_description" = "The Two of Pentacles speaks of good changes, signs of living in harmony with oneself, improving one's material well-being, obtaining diversity and useful interchange. Also, this card can mark the news or some news that will be received in the near future. This indicates a noticeable momentum forward. There is also a negative side of the card, when a person grabs onto several things at the same time, because this is fraught with unpleasant consequences, at least unfinished business. The card can also talk about pleasant chores before meeting desired guests, implementing a new business, receiving good news in the form of a letter or phone call. This card also describes the state of some chaos in the head and disorder in financial affairs. It can describe the inability to maintain financial budgets, as well as hint at the need to restore order in this matter.";
"twoOfSwords_map_description" = "In traditional interpretations, the Two of Swords is considered to be a rather favorable card, with such meanings as harmony, firmness, balanced strength, compensatory factors, agreement, deliberation of decisions, accuracy of judgment, a real assessment of the situation. She is credited with peace of mind, sense of justice, balanced mind and well thought out plans. This card denotes the withdrawal of a person into himself, into his thoughts. At the same time, she can talk about some apathy and a lack of interest in life. In a conflict, the card indicates that the confrontation will not last long and will not be strong enough to really interfere. The choice will be based on a careful weighing of all the pros and cons. But more often, the Two of Swords shows its other meaning - waiting and perseverance in a predicament. There are some unresolved problems, and the current alignment of forces cannot reduce the tension. It could be the calm before the storm. A person is not able to understand how it would be better to act, what to choose. It is not known how events will develop. The situation is ambivalent, uncertain. The Two of Swords speaks of a certain uncertainty of a person about what is happening, about the suppression of emotions and the search for a solution. The card falls out when the questioner is in a kind of mental paralysis, unable to make decisions and act with confidence. The absence of a solution is due to the fact that there are two opposing points of view on the issue, and the person is not ready to accept either of them. Two swords can symbolize two factors that puzzled the questioner. Also, this card can show a dual state or attitude to life, as well as hypocrisy and concealment of the true.";
"twoOfWands_map_description" = "There are two almost opposite interpretations: one associates this card with “initiative and confidence”, the other with “indecision and indifference”, one speaks of luck and power, the other of misfortune and collapse. One explanation for this controversial tradition is given in the section that discusses the deep meaning of the Arcanum. The most positive interpretation of the card - the harmony between the achievements of the past and plans for the future - can be interpreted as conquest and power, carte blanche in gaining strength. It is also quite common to believe that the Two of Wands portends the arrival (appearance) of something unexpected. Something is about to happen that the questioner did not allow in his plans: unforeseen obstacles or problems, something that was not expected. Maybe, for example, unexpected opposition from people from whom it was not expected, the discovery of the existence of some rules that no one knew about, and so on, other cards can give a hint. Another ordinary meaning of this card is a threshold, a crossroads, some kind of life crossroads. Due to the loss of further motivation for new actions, it is difficult to make a decision. Seeing this card means that a person is on the threshold of something, appearing somewhere or leaving somewhere, and he is possessed by a reluctance to take the next step in the chosen direction. It is as if he were looking at the seething stream into which he needs to enter, the leg seems to have already been raised, but it is completely reluctant to take this step and the person would gladly still stand on the shore. The Two of Wands can signal difficulties with choice, decision making. Moreover, the problem is that not a single solution likes a person, does not really suit him. Delaying the final answer. Sometimes the card indicates that the decision is not so important, in fact, almost nothing depends on this choice. Also, the Two of Wands means that the plan is quite achievable, but it will require serious effort and time. At the same time, what is conceived usually refers to the field of intellectual or creative work.";
"twoOfCups_map_description" = "Traditional interpretations of this card: courtship, partnership, union, attraction, attraction, friendship, mutual love, passion, intimacy, affection, harmony of feelings, interchange. This is a map of building a real amazing partnership in which you can rely on a partner, trust him. It will be filled with respect for each other and mutual understanding. This may be a new acquaintance, reconciliation with a former lover, a manifestation of the best feelings in an already established union. The meaning of this card primarily affects the deeply personal, intimate sphere, no matter what it is about - sympathy, light flirting, sudden love, a date after a long separation, or the beginning of new friendships or love relationships. Most often - the formation of feelings between two people. This card is very fond of lovers, and often appears in layouts during a period of bright romantic passion. It serves as a kind of indicator that a person is ready to open up to the love that comes to him, be filled with it and share it. According to her, what separates people loses its meaning - what attracts and connects them becomes much more important. It's also a good offer (in the most traditional sense, hands and hearts, but it could be something just as interesting). The card describes a good acquaintance, cooperation and the establishment of connections that help to reach new favorable prospects. Even if it's not about romance, this card describes benevolent interaction, harmonious relationships, mutual sympathy, harmony, attentiveness and kindness. Its importance is the ability to trust and act in concert.";
"threeOfPentacles_map_description" = "The Three of Pentacles symbolizes evolution, gradual progress. Its appearance does not promise stunning results, noisy victories and the same defeats - it indicates that the goal will be achieved as a result of regular efforts, gradually. The card denies both instant success and stagnation, marking time. She calls to use hard work, diligence, perseverance and discipline as the best means to achieve the goal. Also, this card can symbolize the overall result of a lot of effort. It means working together and helping each other. Things will go uphill, they will start spinning on their own. Her presence in the alignment suggests that ideas materialize, plans come true, dreams come true, and this happens thanks to the efforts of the person himself and the assessment of other people. This is a map of specific actions, work, stabilization of what has been achieved, putting things in order. The Three of Pentacles speaks of the opportunity to roll up your sleeves, work like Carlo's dad, accomplish what has been put off for a long time or get out of the way what gets in the way. The main value is the implementation of projects, moving forward, developing professional skills, acquiring solid knowledge. Demonstration of all accumulated skills, combat readiness. The appearance of the Three of Pentacles in the alignment indicates the importance of joining forces, exchanging opinions in any, even the most individual matter. That is, to solve the problem, at least one or even two more people are needed, the help of some experts, consultants, advisers. The Three of Pentacles can even influence the Major Arcana in the layout: it strengthens (or “reinforces”) the favorable value, and weakens the unfavorable one. It is believed that this card is a sign that the questioner will soon receive something that he passionately desired to acquire. The exact area in which the “fast profit” awaits can be judged by the neighboring cards in the layout.";
"threeOfSwords_map_description" = "The Three of Swords symbolizes pain, tears, grief, the loss of a loved one, anxiety, disappointment, which can cause severe depression. It is possible that the fortuneteller was abandoned, and he is in a state of apathy. Constant failure knocked him out of the normal life cycle. He is annoyed, constantly quarrels with others. He may have heart problems. The Three of Swords always brings to light problems of incompatibility, excessive harshness of communication. The card is generally bleak, it portends a tense unpleasant time. With it, a lot of quarrels and anxieties, anger, situations of mismatch of interests enter life. She bears an unpleasant life lesson. Naturally, in a relationship, feelings often push considerations into the background, and the Three of Swords gives the go-ahead and cuts open the fog of emotional idealization, brings some kind of clash with how “it really is”, and this truth of life causes painful feelings. Therefore, on the “head” card, a bleeding heart is depicted. It may be necessary to give some final answer, and it will be very difficult to do so. The main meaning of the Three of Swords is a choice made contrary to feeling (a person has to give up, renounce something that is dear to him). But what it is, cowardice or, conversely, a step forward, can only be understood by knowing the background of the question asked and checking the rest of the cards that have fallen. Hence some differences in the author's interpretations. It's one thing when feelings (not necessarily one's own, quite possibly someone else's) are brutally suppressed by the mind, and another thing is when the power of the mind managed to escape from the captivity of any addiction. This step is painful, but necessary.";
"threeOfWands_map_description" = "The Three of Wands is a card of growth, stability and success (and other cards usually indicate the area to which this applies). Whatever the question is - personal relationships, career, spiritual growth - this card says that we must continue to move forward, go beyond the current boundaries, stop early. Ideas are inspired and realized along this map, they take shape and receive direction. She promises a successful outcome of the case, regarding which the question was asked. A stable position, strong support and further prosperity, excellent prospects are the main meanings of this card. The map reflects a positive course of events and gives a favorable forecast. She says that a person has already achieved certain heights and will be able to achieve even more in the future. It makes sense to hope for the best and breathe deeply. This card means primary order, its meanings are a solid foundation, success, a strong position. She says that a certain point or point has been reached in the case, where you can not be afraid of anything and look forward with confidence. The card not only speaks of a stable state of affairs at the moment, but also promises further prosperity. The Three of Wands also describes small problems in business that can be resolved. This is a small test, which the questioner is quite capable of overcoming through sound and responsible actions, as well as with the help of friends. In any case, this card says: Everything will be fine! If before that there was a black streak in life, the Three of Wands heralds the end of disasters. Sometimes the importance of preparation is emphasized before taking a decisive step into the future.";
"threeOfCups_map_description" = "The card symbolizes, as a rule, a time of joy, a holiday. The Three of Cups adorns the alignment, it is a card of fulfillment of desires in business or in personal life, it denotes the most joyful development of the situation. It heralds the beginning of a pleasant and carefree period of life, a bright streak. This is the success of the planned business, the restoration of good relations. It shows that something important and beautiful has entered life, or that receiving a gift (from a person or from fate itself) that fills with joy, happiness and gratitude. At a deeper level, the card can mean optimism and a sense of the fullness of being, on the external (event) plane - a holiday, a feast. Its most traditional meaning: a holiday, a booze, a friendly party, a carefree and joyful enjoyment of what is happening. Intoxication with the happiness of being, worldly celebration of the soul. The card heralds a time of joy and passion, when a person is inspired and the heart beats happily. Great time spent, the pleasure received from love and the company of a loved one, the enjoyment of togetherness. This is a very accurate and powerful card! It always brings simple joys that help restore vitality, the fullness of being, feel carefree and happy. If it was a problem, a crisis, the Three of Cups symbolizes the ability to find a good way out of a difficult situation and the relief that fate brings - a happy decision, perhaps coming to a friendly compromise, receiving support from third parties.";
"fourOfPentacles_map_description" = "The Four of Pentacles is a symbol of boundaries - correct, useful, permissible, possible. This card indicates such character traits as honesty, practicality, business acumen, ability to keep one's word, adherence to the law and established standards of behavior. The card describes something built with difficulty, but with a certain margin of safety. It can be anything - business, health, relationships or a value system. This is a card of possession and preservation of what belongs to us, satisfaction with the current situation and the desire to keep it. It symbolizes prudence and careful planning, the willingness to act to achieve the desired stability, or to maintain the existing order. It gives a sense of the ground under one's feet, but...also a sense that some factor threatens the current stability, so that there is a need to protect one's property. Selfishness and greed, the desire to protect their values ​​(time, money, various opportunities), fear of loss, unwillingness to share. This is a kind of blocking and stagnation. Sometimes there are such interpretations as the growth of income and influence. The main meaning is fixing what is, protection, and ensuring integrity and security. This moment makes it somewhat difficult to move forward and prepare yourself for the future. The four says that a person has achieved what he wants and is no longer striving for new heights: and so, what is enough is enough. There is no intention to make any efforts for the sake of gaining more. The ancient meaning is a person who achieves success, but not much. The card symbolizes a certain “ecological niche” occupied by a person in society - he has made his way somewhere, achieved something, is trying to hold on. The success achieved here is natural and is the result of efforts.";
"fourOfSwords_map_description" = "This card speaks of respite, rest and taking time out due to the pointlessness of the struggle at the moment. Forcing events or confronting other people is now not only inappropriate, but almost impossible. All attempts to drastically change the existing order of things will lead nowhere. This card always involves a delay. The Four of Swords is a card of peace and detachment, it absolutely excludes fuss. Its main meanings are solitude and isolation, exile and retreat, respite and temporary departure. In business, no progress. Her main advice is to use this time to rest, reflect on the situations of the last time, restore strength and health, and plan your future more wisely. In this case, it is the experience of a person who has fallen out of the stream. Most react to such a state in a rather negative way, and only a few rejoice at the opportunity to detach, collect their thoughts, be alone with themselves and take a breath. This is a precious respite, a much-needed rest now, a granted refuge from the hustle and bustle. But someone who has worked very hard and invested in something usually perceives the Four of Swords as something amazing. This is the planning of actions in hermit loneliness, the preparation of consciousness for a new round. The Four of Swords is a card of stagnation, interrupted activity and forced rest. The obstacles or difficulties indicated by the Four are usually simple and understandable, and overcoming them does not require us to overturn all the foundations of life. This position is akin to illness, which is also one of the meanings of the card. We are forced to interrupt vigorous activity, to pause. Whether we suffer or try to use this pause to deal with ourselves is up to us. We can use a pause to work on ourselves, but we would hardly arrange it for ourselves of our own free will.";
"fourOfWands_map_description" = "This is a very happy card. Its main meanings are benevolence and prosperity, noticeable and well-deserved success and recognition, excellent atmosphere, “the arrival of happiness”. It brings harmony, self-confidence, balance and building a strong foundation for a happy future. Peace and relaxation go along it, a situation where no troubles and difficulties threaten. Difficulties behind, you can relax and enjoy life. Often she describes a situation where something has been done, useful experience has been gained, but one does not want to go further. I just want to enjoy what I have achieved. The card invites you to joy and fun - life is beautiful! She says that a well-deserved holiday awaits you, having fun, going to events such as: family holidays, banquets, alumni meetings, country parties and picnics. She can also simply bring peace and tranquility, release from responsibility, completion of the case. And even if we are talking about any troubles, these are rather pleasant activities for the soul than righteous labors in the sweat of one's brow. The Four of Wands is the decoration of the layouts, and will largely determine its overall meaning. This card is the keeper of a very positive and powerful energy. It falls in a personal scenario for people who are usually said to be lucky. If in the scenario this card repeatedly falls out, there is no way to complain about life here. This is a sign, if not of extreme luck, then of the mercy of fate, when it is relatively easy at times to get around or overcome difficult situations. Sometimes she indicates unexpected luck, promises a stable development of the business and promises eventual success. According to this card, cases are often processed - legal registration of a business, for example, obtaining a diploma, marriage, concluding an important contract. The Four of Wands describes the high point of development in which a lot of effort has been invested. And it also opens up opportunities for developing new beginnings.";
"fourOfCups_map_description" = "Blueness, despondency, immersion in the past and oblivion of the present are the main meanings of this card. A person does not notice something very important in life, in his situation, he is bored, but this is only his blindness. This card is essentially a friendly warning that a negative view of the world keeps a person from achieving all that he wants and accepting all that he hopes for. All this is available, but one's own dissatisfaction keeps one from recognizing, accepting and using the benefits. This card speaks of various situations, such as when everything is there, but there is not enough spiritual disposition to rejoice at it. It portends the beginning of a stagnant period in life due to the fact that a person rejects new opportunities, does not want to develop creative abilities, start new projects, make new acquaintances because of seeming senselessness. In essence, this card always speaks of the need for honest introspection to restore inner balance, and that efforts must be made to see your life differently than in those dull and dull colors in which you look at it. This is a very small effort that no one will do for a person. Typical meanings: frustration, annoying incidents, problems, something that causes irritation. In fact, this is a map of internal burnout after excessive socialization. One of its names is “morning after a fun night”, with all its apathy, lethargy and “retirement”, when the continuation of the banquet does not appeal. The meaning becomes clear - the negative influence of the past on the present. With something obviously overzealous and fed up. Perhaps such a situation causes annoyance, or the proposal made makes one doubt, or there are well-founded suspicions and dissatisfaction with one's other half, or there was a collision with unexpected obstacles or opposition, but is the devil as terrible as he is portrayed?";
"fiveOfPentacles_map_description" = "The Five of Pentacles is traditionally considered a good card for love and a bad card for money. She portends for men and women marriage for love, at the behest of the heart, but contrary to all mercantile considerations. The Five of Pentacles loves people who live by the soul. It supports the spiritual principle, sometimes destroying the material. It usually means the loss of something material and the acquisition of worldly experience in return, learning a lesson. This is a map of illnesses and failures, obstacles and obstacles on the way, a map of not the best time for great aspirations. All Fives symbolize the beginning of the transformation that should fundamentally change our lives, and this does not go without pain. The spiritual power of this card helps to overcome the life difficulties that overtook him and becomes a natural inner support of a person in material activity, and a true feeling has great power and gives a person the opportunity to rise above circumstances. The traditional meaning is also material hardships, but also the opportunity to receive the spiritual instead of the material. The Five of Pentacles is a card of hard times, crisis, hardships, worries, losses. She speaks of the loss or lack of something necessary. At the same time, the card rarely serves as a harbinger of truly serious losses, sorrows or ruin, but mainly indicates the uncertainty of the situation at the moment of life and the fear experienced to lose the ground under one's feet. It should be remembered that in life, as in any other journey, anxiety is a bad conductor. Such periods of decline are characteristic of any crisis of growth, when a person leaves a certain sphere that has become familiar, stable, and moves into a new, still unfamiliar, and perhaps even dangerous. In any case, she talks about the waste of some resources and energies that exceeded the limits and about the collision with the consequences of all this. Creating reverse wealth requires consistent action.";
"fiveOfSwords_map_description" = "The Five of Swords is a very strong and tangibly negative card and quite dangerous. Its main principle is unscrupulousness. The first meaning to consider is revenge. And only if the situation of the person to whom it falls excludes this, you can look at other values. This card is a sure sign that life is now entering a stressful period, a situation from which it will not be possible to get rid of immediately. The surrounding cards can mitigate its influence, but in any case, this is a period of discouragement, loss and destruction, confrontation with the vicissitudes of fate ... you can only try to get past it with the least losses. This card can also act as advice to get away from a destructive situation, since it is either pointless or too costly to fight. The card also often denotes an aggravation of the conflict, a vile scandal, low blows, treachery, meanness, some kind of intrigue from outside and hostility. At the same time, the card does not say where all these harmful actions come from: from the person himself or he was drawn into this unseemly story as a victim. This can be reported by neighboring cards in the layout. The Five of Swords means an unfair victory that will not please the winner for long. The role of the Five of Swords may vary somewhat depending on the personality of the person. Strong, aggressive and combative natures on this map are more likely to be in the role of an offender, and not a defeated one. One of the meanings of the card, the brightest, is “empty victories”, “bitter successes”. Darker meanings are “destruction, loss, dishonor.” It reveals such characteristics of the situation as misfortune, tragic situation, heavy loss, grief, blackmail, compromising evidence. In fact, this is the only Tarot card that is associated with such words as shame, shame, shame.";
"fiveOfWands_map_description" = "The main meaning of this card is the struggle with other people, possible competitors who use the same methods as yourself, but have the opposite opinion. To a greater extent, this is an open clash with equal rivals, rather than deceit. This card speaks of defending one's own interests among the same smart and worthy opponents. The map provides an opportunity to compare your abilities and abilities with those of others. The Five of Wands is a typical environment of a not particularly constructive format - everyone competes with everyone, argues, competes and everyone disagrees with everyone, but this is just a convention. In the worst case scenario, this is involvement in a clash, a battle of ideas, an aggressive discussion environment, the participants of which are not constructive, do not respect each other, and in any case you have to defend yourself. At its best, it's a rewarding brainstorming session where you can test your ideas against disagreements with others. The action of this card mainly indicates the development of events at work, in a team, and may also relate to family disputes. Its main meaning is constructive criticism, healthy competition. It has challenge and tension. She offers to test your strength, will, skills, talents, knowledge in competition with others. It can be an exam or defense of a diploma, participation in some kind of competition, competition, in general, experiencing situations whose experience will be useful in the future. Usually this card falls out in situations where it is necessary to show courage and demonstrate to others everything that we are capable of. You never know how all this, in fact, will end, but you can try to turn the situation to your advantage, preferably without harming others. Sometimes she describes a situation where a person is trying to attract the attention of other people, somehow direct them, but no one listens to him and does not really cooperate, as a result, things do not go well. In the space of this map, an atmosphere of disagreement, contradictions and rivalry clearly reigns.";
"fiveOfCups_map_description" = "The card vividly personifies talking about disappointment, unexpected troubles, melancholy, sadness, pain, grief and regret for the lost. Its most traditional meanings are difficult relationships or unexpected troubles and interference in business, but the main thing is grief for the lost. The card may indicate the loss of something that was important for a person for a long time, or that something important did not happen. This card is associated with strong emotions, it can be righteous anger or love suffering, but most often it is mental pain that cannot be overcome ahead of time, an emotional crisis, depression. Something that once brought joy and delighted the soul is left behind, and this pain must be comprehended and experienced. This is also a card of perfectionism, thinking about what happened in the format: if you did it this way, it would be different. This is not a cosmetic correction of ideas, this is a radical disappointment in which the person himself does not see anything positive. Emptiness can make room for new filling, but being in the space of this card, a person cannot yet see what will reward him for this. This card implicitly contains the potential for new possibilities or a new way of looking at things that a person is not yet able to turn to. This card indicates a somewhat false point of view, and often does not reflect real events, but rather represents a projection of fears and doubts on the issue for which the layout was made. The trap of this card is getting stuck in sadness. Who looks only back will not notice love, even if it is very close. This is such a deep immersion in thoughts about your loss that a person stops paying attention to other goals and opportunities - after all, we live in a dual world, where every negative event has a positive one, and almost every loss can be considered as an acquisition. If we missed some opportunities and lost what was dear to us, we still have to turn the page and continue to move on. And it is worth coming to terms with the bummer in life that this card speaks of. Only by letting go of the past and regretting it can a person move on.";
"sixOfPentacles_map_description" = "Let not unconditionally and fully, but this is a fairly favorable card. This is a card of gifts of fate, rewards, restored well-being, solving old problems, getting what you want, hopes come true, material benefits. She says that a person will certainly be generously rewarded for his work and efforts, for the past path of overcoming and trouble. The Universe will show generosity, and it will be deserved. The card can guarantee a reward, success, a promising project. Everything that seemed lost at the stage of Fives, returns in Sixes. As for the suit of Pentacles, this is health and money. Old problems are being resolved and completed, while new beginnings have good, far-reaching prospects. This card teaches understanding - be generous and open to others and to the universe, and it will be generous for you too. Life knows how to give and bestow, and one cannot remain indebted to it. If we owe something to someone, then the debt should be repaid. If someone has rendered us a service, we must pay him off or at least thank him. The Six of Pentacles denotes such qualities as willingness to help, to show generosity and tolerance. It may indicate that we ourselves have such qualities, or that someone will show them in relation to us. And we are not talking about a momentary impulse or ostentatious piety, but about natural and permanent character traits. Various acts of charity and patronage, mercy and mercy, leveling the balance in the system, overcoming internal contradictions follow this card. According to this card, you can put in order some area that has been launched - whether it be physical condition, work affairs or financial situation. The card does not speak about the future and the past, it is all relevant right now. The Six of Cups is a clear sign of the past. The Six of Swords has to do with the secrets of the past and the uncertainty of the future, again we are talking about the time factor. And the Six of Pentacles describes the magical moment of the present. All sixes teach to see things in their integrity, interconnectedness and systemic continuity, that is, through time. The traditional meaning is a gift, getting what you want.";
"sixOfSwords_map_description" = "The key meaning of this card is a way out, an escape from an overly tense situation. It brings a way out of a difficult, confusing or even dangerous situation, avoiding problems. This is expedient behavior to overcome difficulties, distancing from what is happening, restoring calm and composure, the ability to get out of a situation where everything is too confused. These are new life prospects, new goals and new means. This card speaks of a willingness to leave behind sorrows and head towards new shores of life, even if the changes are not very enthusiastic and there are some doubts about the chosen direction. Balance can be achieved by finding a secluded place, a safe haven. Sometimes, in order to find something like this, you just have to run away from a difficult situation. According to the Six of Swords, there is an escape from serious troubles - hard work, difficult relationships, unprofitable business. This is a departure from hectic activity, hassle. A positive value indicates that the period of stress in the past and now everything will gradually begin to improve, change, there is some kind of dynamics, alignment is taking place. The end result is unknown. We are usually talking about the forced need to independently follow the chosen path, about separation, about changing orientations, and the need to focus on the positive prospects of such a decision, mobilize all mental strength, externally and internally calm down and open up to new life lessons. At first it will be scary, but it will bring newness to life, and experiences will become quieter. This card is a sign of a successful resolution of the situation, the achievement of the desired changes. It promises a relatively harmonious stage of life, an atmosphere of relative peace and tranquility after bad situations, relaxation after a stressful period. This card can also mark trips and travels, a change of scenery, place of residence, place of work, moving. It can also be the discovery of something new in oneself, a change in mental orientation, the assimilation of new rules of the game, new norms of life, new values, or acquaintance with other cultures and religions. The Six of Swords can also be associated with learning, activities related to intellectual development - courses, exhibitions, reading, searching for information on the Internet, in general, the transfer of ideas, information, useful information, with the search for truth. This is the work of the mind, penetration into secrets, accumulation of information, awareness of future prospects, fair understanding. Creative mental activity, objective analysis, an attempt to plan a disturbing future.";
"sixOfWands_map_description" = "This card carries a congratulatory meaning and says that for some time you can exhale, the victory is won, the result is achieved. The card symbolizes the favorable outcome of any business, bringing it to a victorious end, the triumph of will and courage. Her appearance in the layout heralds that a bright streak begins and fate favors the person to whom this card fell, and hopes and dreams are quite feasible and achievable. Hopes will come true, wishes will come true, gifts will be received. The card says: you will confidently reach the victorious end, overcome difficulties, do not lose your optimistic mood. This is a card of conquests and victories, bright prospects, success in life, progress, efforts that bring rewards, certainly not without efforts applied to the struggle. If other cards in the layout hint at some kind of struggle, then the Six of Wands says that the battle will be crowned with a triumphant success. This card, as a rule, falls out after some hard life test, a period of hard work, giving a reason for joy. Even if this is not the case, in any case, her appearance suggests that this period is very favorable for undertakings, whether it be creating a family, climbing the career ladder, new beginnings, projects, building a business. Success in any chosen field of activity is guaranteed! All sorts of important and joyful news are also under the jurisdiction of the Six of Wands. Successful business trips follow this card. The final thought of the Six of Wands suggests that all the obstacles and difficult moments passed are needed in order for a person to become more mature, strong and courageous in order to further advance along his path, gaining strength and firmness. We are talking about victory after a struggle and a well-deserved reward. This card cannot be called personal and related to what is hidden in the soul, it always has an element of pomp and parade - the promulgation of success, its proclamation for others, public veneration.";
"sixOfCups_map_description" = "The card describes a harmless situation, faith in a miracle, naivety, a refuge of joy, nostalgia for the good old past, succeeding effortlessly in a harmonious environment, the manifestation of generosity, generosity and love, the joy of life and inner harmony, well-being and uplift, even if only emotional. The card says that an almost forgotten dream will suddenly come true. A card of memories of the past, romantic feelings, it means past hobbies, from the influence of which a person has already completely or partially freed himself. The card speaks of the awakening of long-forgotten desires, past aspirations, intentions and plans. Something will clearly remind you of the past - people, places, meetings, events. This card is used to turn the pages of one's own book of life. She is in charge of both ordinary, not going beyond one life, and the so-called karmic memory. According to the six of cups, the best times do not come, the best times return. The appearance of this card indicates that something or someone will again make you see the good in life. And the best that this card can give is the inner knowledge that there is happiness, it basically happens, and if you were once already happy, you can achieve it again, learn it again. This card shows that a person can know happiness again, that happiness can return, especially if the situation is favorable. The feeling of inspiration and faith fills you with light and joy and inspires you to take new steps. Impulses coming from the past give strength to bring to life something important here and now, and experience allows you to change a lot in life for the better. Sometimes the presence of a card in the layout indicates that the root of the problem is in the childhood of the questioner, it may indicate some episodes or impressions of the early years. According to the six of cups, there are family celebrations, special dates, memorable days, as well as just a meeting with people whom we have not seen for a hundred years.";
"sevenOfPentacles_map_description" = "The Seven of Pentacles is the process card started earlier. There is no result yet, but it must be persistently waited for, constantly correcting the situation. How satisfactory this result will be - the neighboring cards will tell. And yet - this is a card of income received as a result of persistent work. She says that the man worked hard and for a long time, he managed the money correctly. Now the most important thing is to wait for the harvest. Patience and abstinence will bring good results, but impatience will not give the maximum result, and then it will be possible to talk about the inconsistency of the harvest obtained with the efforts expended. The card reminds us that development should not stop. It should be understood that a person cannot speed up events. In fact, the card indicates success that has not yet been received, which a person has already set his sights on and even could feel himself in it. But this success still needs time, although at this stage it is already possible to assess whether this very success will come or not. This card can also have a meaning - failure, insolvency, unpromising investments. It can symbolize the process of destruction, withering or dying of something not very successful, unviable, and the meaning of its message is something like this: the faster a person realizes that the horse he is pulling is already dead, the faster he will recover from depression and disappointment. But in general, this card inspires hope for the flow of some process that has not yet been completed and will require further efforts and investments. This is a card of profit received as a reward for labor, and this applies to any area where the person who has this card has worked long and hard. This is a continuous gradual growth that brings satisfaction both from the process itself and from the result. Take this card as confirmation that you have done everything right in your garden of life. Now you just have to wait for the fruit to ripen.";
"sevenOfSwords_map_description" = "The Seven of Swords is a card of compromise reached in a not entirely honest, or rather, even completely dishonest way. We can safely say that a person got out of the situation through cunning and various subterfuges, seeing only the goal in front of him and not thinking about the means. The card speaks of a dishonest person who, contrary to moral principles, builds his own line of behavior. To understand whether the person himself is drawn like this or whether he will face a scammer and a thief, nearby cards will tell. In addition to insincerity, a person will also need good skill, because he will have to hide all his motives and arrange everything so that no one gets stuck. To this we must also add prudence, intelligence, the ability to quickly accept non-standard thinking. It cannot be said that the card is frankly negative. Sometimes you have to deal with circumstances through not entirely benign actions. There are white lies too. But how to understand where is the line of permissible violations, and where are actions with far-reaching consequences? This card describes an attempt to find a way out of a difficult situation with the help of some tricks and machinations, to avoid conflict. She points to the need to show cunning, think with your head, go for strategic tricks. The Seven of Swords always raises the question of the correctness of actions and the plausibility of intentions. At the same time, this card may simply indicate that we have to test the speed and effectiveness of thinking and considerations. It describes the ability to act by cunning, covertly, the ability to escape from danger, not to conflict openly with the enemy. The only question is how big the deception is, what it generally concerns and what it is fraught with. You just need to act subtly and not overdo it. Overconfidence in the correctness of their concepts in this situation can lead to collapse. It can also mean the need to be on the lookout, because someone is not going to keep promises or tries to cheat. The Seven of Swords can indicate an issue that the person is avoiding, especially if there are other cards in the spread that indicate stress. He does not like what is happening, it is difficult to accept it, and he somehow deceives himself and others. It is hiding secrets and avoiding responsibility.";
"sevenOfWands_map_description" = "This is a card for the elimination of rivals, in business and in love. Even if it seems that superior forces are attacking, the Seven of Wands clearly communicates that the advantage is on the side of the person who has this card. It appears when some forces appear on the horizon, seeking to throw us off course in some sense. The card calls to defend what a person believes in and what he considers valuable. She advises not to make concessions and not betray your principles. Sometimes her appearance indicates that only by taking a truly desperate step can one win a hopeless case. This is a card of perseverance in adversity, challenge to battle and overcoming obstacles, firmness, courage and victory. This card confirms that there is a danger, and it is quite real, but in this particular case, nothing threatens a person, so you need to act more boldly. The card also indicates the fact that in order to achieve goals and implement ideas, you will have to sweat a lot, but in themselves they are quite feasible. If there are positive cards in the layout, it can be quite confidently asserted that the person to whom the card fell will benefit from the situation in which he finds himself, everything will turn out in his favor. If a person is faced with some kind of problem, the Seven of Wands says that he has the skills, knowledge and ability to do everything right in this difficult situation. It is important to understand that the Seven of Wands in a layout often indicates not so much a problem as a resource that a person has. In general, this card is a movement forward, success. The right time for a risky game, the opportunity to count on luck. Overcoming doubts and obstacles, including internal ones, also ending competition and winning. The Seven of Wands in the layout is a sign of upcoming difficulties, but these difficulties will not always entail any problems. Rather, these changes will bring a lot of interesting things to life and lead to a general improvement in the situation, unless other cards of the layout contradict this. Occasionally, and the environment of the corresponding cards, we are talking about a physical attack. If they are asking not about an individual person, but about a group or community, then the Seven of Wands can also mean injuries and victims, although there will not be many of them compared to the total number of people included in this community.";
"sevenOfCups_map_description" = "This card describes the presence of various possibilities, the abundance of which is confusing and it is not clear what decision would be best to make. When this card falls out, it is not easy for a person to determine his own desires and understand what he really wants. She can also say that a person once again takes wishful thinking. The presence in the alignment may indicate that so far there is nothing obvious, permanent, definite and significant. Sometimes the card hints that the whole thing is nothing more than an illusion, or speaks of the instability of achievements. The Seven of Cups is a card of fog, mirages and ghosts. It shows that there is a risk of succumbing to deceptive hopes, misconceptions and deceptions. As a rule, it acts as a harbinger of sobering up, that is, disappointment. The Seven of Cups may indicate that the person to whom this card has fallen is overcome by some kind of temptation. Maybe tempting offers come to him from all sides, maybe he himself amuses himself with some dreams. Cups symbolize the dreams and doubts of a person who is thinking about what to choose, but in reality all this is a false choice. All these gifts are just a temptation, an illusion: whatever a person chooses, it will not bring him happiness. The pursuit of mirages ends in the void. This card is drawn when it seems that all possible options are known, and it is only necessary to choose one of them. But in fact, in this case, you need to find another option, completely different and still unknown, or at least postpone the decision, because now it simply cannot be correct. The appearance of the card has always been considered an indication of unrealizable hopes, impossible desires, false promises and far-fetched decisions. If a person cannot even imagine how he achieves his goals, then his brain is categorically not ready to help along this path. Sometimes the Seven of Cups describes bad company, communication with people who do not behave in the best way, moving away from reality, engaging in fraud or not seeing the trouble in addictions. At best, the presence of this card in the layout indicates an emotion that inspires a person to certain actions, and also indicates that he has a choice. The Seven of Cups has another interesting feature - it promises help and support from those from whom it was not expected, in case the illusions are nevertheless dispelled, and some intelligible and understandable intention appears for others. In this case, others come to the rescue, although it may have an unexpected appearance.";
"eightOfPentacles_map_description" = "This card promises a slow but steady progress in the fact that the main thing is to stay in reality. She reports on the labor process, on the investment of strength and energy in some business, that everything is in the hands of the person involved in this business, and everything is going right, but it requires attention to detail and continued efforts. Skillful, masterful, and very meticulous work is the typical meaning of this card, usually clear at first glance. Extreme concentration and complete immersion in work. The Eight of Pentacles says that a person has got a taste, the business has become creative for him and brings pleasure and knowledge. This is a card of Creation, purposeful use of energy, accumulation and application of skills. Whatever it is, it is a path of personal effort that slowly but surely leads to good results. It may be the acquisition of new skills, which naturally leads to an increase in earnings or the receipt of some privileges, but the secret of this card is to create, and not to chase rewards and results. She teaches a lesson in diligence, the ability to turn every action into a creative ritual. There is nothing in any business other than what you bring into it yourself. There is no uninteresting work - any work is as interesting as you are interesting. This card tells you to love work for the sake of its creative and cognitive beginning, and not to tune in selfishly, relying in advance on some specific payment. Then success and prosperity will come. In general, this card symbolizes the deep satisfaction that a person receives from the excellent use of his talents and abilities. Planned diligent daily work, prudent planning, calm and careful orderliness of all affairs. This is the reward of the old skill and the rapid acquisition of a new one, the teaching of a specific practical art, the expansion of one's horizons. Acquisition of new skills. Energetic and efficient work due to discipline, previous experience, accumulated knowledge, skill. A card of mature professionalism, commitment, skill and inspiration in work, autonomy and independence. A person knows well what he is striving for and how to achieve it, and nothing can stop him. Accuracy, accuracy and attention to detail become a source of passion.";
"eightOfSwords_map_description" = "The card is quite unpleasant, indicating getting into a very difficult situation. She warns that things may go the wrong way, meet some obstacles. The card can describe an unpleasant situation that has already occurred. This is a map of restrictions. It describes the states of being bound, confused, helpless, a person does not feel free and cannot live the way he likes. Sometimes a card falls out at a moment when life is pressing from all sides, tangled circumstances do not allow you to do at least something as you would like, and you constantly have to give up your own desires. The card hints at the fact that a person allowed absolutely everyone to manage his life to someone else. He gave away power, gave away power, became a hostage to what someone else does or does not do and does not expect anything from himself, as if nothing in this world depended on him. In reality, though, it shouldn't be. The card is a clear indicator of incarceration, sometimes quite literally. Often, imprisonment turns out to be rather internal - a person is forced to agree with something, pay for the mistakes made, admit and atone for his guilt, stepping on the throat of his own ego. This card raises the question of who is in charge in the situation under consideration, who controls it, and on whom its outcome actually depends. Through the Eight of Swords, disapproval, criticism, slander, slanderous discussion and condemnation pass, where a person becomes a victim, humiliated and insulted at the pillory. But the situation that this card describes hints at learned helplessness, with the help of which a person created it for himself with his fears, driven out, taking responsibility and lack of initiative. The Eight of Swords emphasizes the temporary nature of troubles. This situation can be avoided, prevented on their own. The best thing about this card is that it contains the potential for liberation. If a person takes responsibility for his life, he will be able to pull himself out of this state.";
"eightOfWands_map_description" = "This is a very optimistic card and it indicates an undoubted progress towards the goal. The confluence of circumstances is such that expected events begin to unfold uncontrollably, everything is in motion, there is no longer any opposition, and soon something will happen. Usually this card heralds favorable events for the person to whom it falls. She also speaks of the rapid speed of events unfolding. It shows that something is changing, something is in the air and will come sooner than a person expects, and this process has already begun. If the question concerns long-term plans, then they will come true and, in any case, will enter a decisive phase. This is a sign that something is on the way - news that will be received soon, unexpected solutions to problems, fortunate coincidences. If the balance in some matter has been lost, then its restoration is not far off. It also indicates the timely arrival of help, energy, information, inspiration - and the person himself usually knows perfectly well which area of ​​his life needs it most now. The Eight of Wands is an indicator of speed. This is not the case when people look closely, sniff and rub against each other for a long time. Here you will not have time to look back, as you will find that your head is lost, love is progressing and events are developing at the fifth speed. The need to quickly and uncompromisingly make some kind of decision. The situations that this card can set are quite sharp and uncompromising. The map in the layouts refers to those cases that are somehow stuck in a dead center. The Eight of Wands is the answer. Travel. Country picnic. Generally easy, pleasant, and very active pastime. Perhaps a vacation, a time of freedom. Receiving an important message. This may be welcome news or some kind of surprise that no one expected. In general, this card is spring, a period of prosperity, new life, new opportunities and prospects. This is a second wind and a new movement forward - towards the possibilities!";
"eightOfCups_map_description" = "This is one of the three breakthrough cards, denoting a sad goodbye. She says that a person is somehow involved in the process of parting with the past, a transitional period when his life goals and priorities change. The most traditional meaning of the Eight of Cups is forgetting and letting go of previous plans. What until recently worried, inspired, loses its attractiveness, a person’s interest in this weakens, for some reason he stops living with it. This card can also describe farewell to old grief, old ideas, connections, habits. This is the determination to embark on a thorny path in the name of higher considerations, leaving the former life. But what are these considerations and what is this path, the map does not say, the surrounding maps can give a hint. A person realizes the impossibility for himself of the former path, voluntarily leaves something well known for the sake of the unknown, changes one concern for another. It is believed that this is a harbinger of changes in life that will affect as positively as they can be negatively perceived at the moment. Ahead of a series of successes, but now, perhaps, you have to sacrifice something familiar and what once pleased. The decision is voluntary, but it is made with a heavy heart in a situation that feels like a hopeless one. Perhaps a man has found something extraordinary, and yet for some reason it has to be abandoned. Former interests, affections, worries and desires are abandoned to the mercy of fate, a person leaves on an unknown path on his journey himself, because he simply cannot stay. At the same time, resignation to fate is expressed as a refusal to control and predict the results. The most important point that the card describes is that one depreciates for the sake of the other. Perhaps the person realized the inferiority of the former life. In a negative environment, it can really indicate a kind of eclipse, a dark hour of life, when the situation is hopeless, the forces are exhausted, the battle is lost and nothing is needed anymore. In a more positive sense, a person is unleashed from the past, throws the usual swamp and goes into voluntary exile - to evolve. According to this card, a person says goodbye to what leads him astray, be it people, activities, habits, in order to concentrate on what fills life with true meaning. She shows that he must leave the familiar environment, part with people or things and go on a long journey, into an unknown future, changing his lifestyle. In any case, it testifies that we were a man who was expelled, and he himself, of his own free will, decided to leave. By the way, the meaning of the card also includes the possibility that a person makes a big problem for himself - everything is not at all so scary, not so important and not so grandiose, he will understand this as soon as he starts taking the first steps and sees everything from a closer distance.";
"nineOfPentacles_map_description" = "The card sets a person in a positive mood, because it symbolizes material growth, financial success, and improved well-being. It may indicate an unexpected profit or gain. This Arkan speaks of exceptional luck. In a person's life, unexpected situations occur that bring him pleasant surprises. The Nine of Pentacles indicates that a person can carry out his plans, achieve his goals. He expects success and prosperity. Moreover, this success will be lasting, protected from various unforeseen circumstances. The card does not speak of carefree time and resting on the laurels of success, it indicates stability and peace after a job well done. All worries are behind, life and circumstances are in full order, a person has taken his confident position in society, he can only enjoy the fruits of his work. He achieved all this himself thanks to his own efforts and talents. A person has reached a certain comfort, but now it is important not to disturb it. To do this, it is necessary to observe personal discipline, which was built under the Eight of Pentacles, not be content with what you have received, but look for new opportunities to improve well-being, be prudent in any life issues, take care of your wealth and its security. With such a card, fate constantly throws up very good moments, and a person must be ready to turn them to his advantage. He now has every chance to implement ideas, so you need to take advantage of any situation. In addition, the card indicates the receipt of gifts, winnings, unexpected and rather big profits from any source. The Nine of Pentacles can also mean receiving an inheritance.";
"nineOfSwords_map_description" = "The Nine of Swords rarely carries a specific threat, but the psychological state it describes is so difficult and unpleasant that it is not for nothing that it is considered one of the most unfavorable cards that can appear in the layout. This is an uncontrollable wave of anxiety, longing, fear, guilt, horror of life, which rises in the unconscious. It often brings with it a state of neurosis, insomnia, anxiety - everything that literally makes a person dry up and exhaust himself. This is a kind of internal torture chamber. This card indicates that a person suffers in one way or another and some kind of misfortune oppresses him. May contain information indicating the presence of irreconcilable enemies in a person. But most often a person is his own enemy to such an extent with his habit of hiding his head in the sand from problems that frighten him, that external enemies are not required by fate. This card indicates that something greatly disturbs a person, possibly depriving him of peace and sleep. In the worst case, he is currently undergoing a real test of losses and it seems to him that the whole world is against him, and fate has set itself the goal of destroying him. This image of sleepless nights corresponds to a state of deep concern and depression. There may be an unclean conscience that does not allow sleep, or a feeling of some kind of danger to life, for example, illness or bereavement. The card depicts night terrors, when we lie awake, tormented by our thoughts, and wait for the dawn. At the same time, she does not say what exactly is so depressing: a sense of guilt or shame that drives sleep away, a feeling of insecurity in front of a difficult test, a powerless experience of failure, or some real danger that threatens our lives. It shows only despair, melancholy, preoccupation, a sudden nightmarish awakening, a sleepless night, an atmosphere of darkness and suffering. In any case, the card says that a person has something to think about, and this “what” upsets and scares him. Perhaps a person knows what to do, but considers active actions too painful. Usually a person is not able to endure this torture for a long time and finds a way to end it. The map can still point to residual effects from past or even imaginary problems than to the problems themselves.";
"nineOfWands_map_description" = "The Nine of Wands speaks of the ability to solve life's problems, the ability to protect oneself, the determination and perseverance in achieving the goal. In the layouts, this card speaks of the desire to defend oneself and the ability of a person to cope with problems. This is a map of the tension of all vitality and stubbornness. This self-protection can be interpreted both positively and negatively. She speaks of gaining tremendous strength, of the ability to withstand any tests from fate, from people for strength, to adequately withstand any obstacles, trials and challenges of reality. One of the main meanings of this card is courage at gunpoint. This card can also be called a victory card, to about the same extent as the Six of Wands. Compared to the latter, it has less brightness and extraordinaryness, it is a map of the will and personal inner strength of the questioner. Therefore, this card can be considered a good sign if it falls to a person who is faced with serious problems, dangers and obstacles. This is a card of mastery, self-confidence, exertion of one's strength, endurance, perseverance and courage, its energy indicates the ability to endure in the most difficult situations. She can also talk about a significant life shake-up experienced and about the need to recover and look around after it. The Nine of Wands is, of course, a difficult card, as it describes the opposition of some extraneous forces and interventions. Most often, it indicates the incompleteness of a situation, whether it is an unfinished gestalt from the past, an unfinished state of affairs in the present, or the absence of a final outcome in the future. Sometimes when this card appears, there are delays, and a person is forced to tensely expect something. The Nine of Wands means stubbornness, resistance to any situation or event, from which only trouble is usually expected. At the same time, she says that there is most likely no threat, but there are only our memories of past troubles, from where the current defensive state comes from.";
"nineOfCups_map_description" = "The Nine of Cups is a card of deep satisfaction, harmony, fulfillment of desires, complete satisfaction with events and the result of actions. In general, this is the ability to enjoy life and find beauty in it, even if the circumstances are not rosy enough. This is business success. If there are unfavorable cards in the layout, they will only create temporary obstacles and troubles, but will not cancel the final success. This is a fairly strong card, a card of desires - it guarantees their fulfillment. Everything that a person hoped for has happened or will happen very soon, and maybe even better than he dreamed. This card brings gifts of fate. In a simpler sense, the card speaks of the opportunity to relax, take a walk for glory, have a good time without worrying about the future, pamper yourself. If anxiety is still present, then the card marks a favorable conclusion. This card brings pleasant events. This is a card of celebration and idleness. It hosts parties, events and pleasant pastimes, quite possibly with a sufficient amount of alcoholic drinks. Or, in principle, in individual cases, it can identify a tendency to alcohol. This is a very strong sign of joy and prosperity, happy times. The card indicates that at this stage all suffering and worries are behind, a new, bright period begins in life. The card symbolizes protection from the vicissitudes of fate. It can also talk about the need for recovery, about finding the most pleasant and useful pastime, the greatest emotional satisfaction. It can also indicate that the time has come for a person to enjoy the results of his work, because they cannot but rejoice. His success is obvious, he went to him for a long time and at the moment deserved the highest praise. In the layout, the card can also indicate the time allotted for rest, and this rest will be very productive for a person, since during this period he will not need anything. The card recommends even trying to indulge in idleness, not caring about anything. If at the moment there are some reasons for trouble and unrest, then you should calm down, because the card promises the resolution of the situation in the best possible way. The loss of the Nine of Cups in the alignment suggests that a person is completely protected from any vicissitudes of fate. A period of only pleasant events awaits him, in which there simply cannot be a place for suffering. Whatever a person thinks, he will definitely receive complete emotional and material satisfaction.";
"tenOfPentacles_map_description" = "The Ten of Pentacles is a card of wealth, stability, fullness of life and confidence in the future. At the same time, wealth and fullness can manifest itself both externally and internally. The main meanings of this card are prosperity, reliability and security, the fulfillment of cherished material desires. The card says that something has already been done and completed by a person, achieved, and the need has come to move to the next level regarding both relationships and professional activities. The card speaks of a time of confidence, reliability and prosperity, a very stable life phase. She promises the great favor of life, the acquisition of all sought-for values. She portends the success of the planned business, and a feeling of peace and happiness after its completion. She also talks about heritage - land, property, money, moral values. This is a card of hereditary aristocracy and secular success and speaks of good luck in everything. The Ten of Pentacles is the most positive card, indicating a high level of human well-being, gaining a strong status position, stability in any area. He speaks of stability on his feet, having weight in society and confidence in the future. The card also notifies that a person has worked for a long time, wisely distributed his finances, did not make unnecessary expenses, and at the moment he is enjoying the benefits that he has earned. Ten of Pentacles denotes not only material wealth, although it is mentioned first of all. It is also the wealth of the inner world, the wealth of personal experience, knowledge and skills. The card promises good luck in all areas of human life. Whatever a person thinks at the moment, his plans will be feasible. The card screams about the well-being achieved and being at the peak of one's capabilities. On the one hand, a person has a reason to be proud of himself and rejoice in his achievements, on the other hand, he will have to look for motivation for later life, since he has reached the limit and he simply has nothing more to strive for. Here comes an important point: a person will not miss his happiness, he will be able to continue to enjoy life if he nobly and generously shares what he has, teaches and passes everything on to his successor, society, loved ones.";
"tenOfSwords_map_description" = "Ten of Swords is one of the most unpleasant and unfavorable cards. Mainly because other not-so-pleasant cards can mean hits that can be taken, pain that can be overcome, problems and difficulties that can be dealt with, but this card ... This is the end, disappointment, brokenness, a complete fiasco. Everything is pointless. So fate decreed and further actions are useless. A dozen swords predicts complete failure. This is a card of pain, failure and devastation. At best, it cancels luck, and at worst, it exacerbates the failure predicted by other cards. Improvements will be short-lived, plans will fail, and a catastrophic outcome can undermine self-confidence. If all is well, this card portends a collision with difficult circumstances, and if all is bad, the end of trouble. The Ten of Swords represents completion, the end of some difficult period, the end of something, decay, destruction. The Ten of Swords speaks of an artificial, forced, sometimes violent end. Such an end is often accompanied by difficult, painful experiences. This card can also symbolize the mighty power of the Mind, which decided to draw a line under a certain life stage, in which there could be important attachments and circumstances of life, but there could also be unpleasant situations, bad habits or a difficult, unfavorable period. One way or another, this is the moment of parting with someone or something. The best that a dozen of swords tells is the end of some difficult and dark period. The end of the past has come, it won't get worse, it can't get any worse. This period is grief, sadness, pain, tears, suffering, despair. Ten of Swords is quite a fatal card. The only time you can treat the Ten of Swords without worry is when it falls at the end of difficult, bleak events. Here it will denote the death of this particular period. What will follow after this period - the nearby cards will tell. In some way, a dozen swords echoes the major lasso death, they are quite similar in meaning, but there is a significant difference in them, which speaks far from in favor of dozens of swords. In the death card, the end of the process is predictable, logical and expected, but in the ten of swords it is a violent end. But as with any completion, a new beginning can follow, and it depends only on the person whether he will raise himself after the fall or not.";
"tenOfWands_map_description" = "The Ten of Wands symbolizes the strength, will and endurance that are needed to cope with the once conceived business. This is the ultimate test of willpower, courage and self-confidence, the exertion of all forces and resources. These qualities are rarely inherent in people in the proper amount, few people have such strong energy, so the situation begins to seem difficult and uncontrollable. In this card, the fiery energy has reached its maximum and now limits freedom. Therefore, there are feelings of suppression of actions and limited opportunities. Therefore, the classic meaning of the card: an unbearable burden and lack of perspective. A difficult situation, when and how it will end, it is not clear. The goals seem unattainable, the pressure of circumstances - insurmountable. As a forecast, this card suggests that it is better not to take on the planned business, because now it is unbearable for a person. The Ten of Wands indicates that at the moment events for a person are burdensome. He cannot get rid of their pressure on himself, but is forced to solve all issues, demonstrating endurance, strength and the will to win. Outwardly, everything seems not only heavy, but also uncontrollable. The person is currently depressed, disappointed in his life and fearful of the future. He took problems and obstacles with him from the past and carries them, not feeling the strength to throw him off. Also, the card may indicate that a person has taken on other people's obligations, too, in addition to his own, and this has exhausted him. In a sense, he is limited in his freedom of decision-making, he does not see opportunities and prospects. He took on an unbearable burden that he could not cope with. The map warns that you should not even start what is planned at this stage, since it will be very, very difficult to achieve results, and you won’t even understand if you can implement all the plans as you would like. At the moment there are no favorable circumstances for this.";
"tenOfCups_map_description" = "By itself, this card identifies the house, hearth and family relationships. It may indicate the presence or influence of the relevant forces in this matter, and sometimes that the events described by other cards will affect the family life and the immediate environment of the person to whom this card fell. The main meaning of this card is the highest harmony, completion and fulfillment. This is undoubtedly an omen of a successful future. This is the fulfillment of desires, when nothing remains unfulfilled. In general, this card is a holiday and its appearance is a very good sign, no matter what it is about. This is a very powerful card, it strengthens the good cards in the layout and rejects the unfavorable ones. If the person to whom this card has fallen is interested in the prospect of achieving some goal, success awaits him. If you are worried about some difficult situation - there is no danger in it, everything will be resolved for the better beyond all expectations. If there are depressing circumstances, the card is like a light at the end of a tunnel. The meaning of this card for the event is true, deep, wholesome love and everything connected with it, unity with a loved one, complete satisfaction with personal life. Marriage for love, successful family life, support and understanding from the family. In general, the card denotes harmony, emotional and spiritual fullness, successful completion. Ten of Cups predicts a very successful future, devoid of problems. This is a card that describes human happiness in its entirety. She promises the most positive solution to the problem, the task that the person has set for himself will be completed with great success. It means a favorable way out of a situation of any complexity and confusion.";
